OL,3,GNEWSAEsther Rantzen says she is too
OL,4,Afragile to travel to Switzerland to end
OL,5,Alife
OL,6,
OL,7,FDame Esther Rantzen has said she is now
OL,8,F"too physically fragile" to travel to
OL,9,FSwitzerland to end her life at an
OL,10,Fassisted suicide clinic.
OL,12,FThe veteran broadcaster, 86, said she
OL,13,Fwould have to fly to the country, where
OL,14,Fthe practice is legal, alone, which she
OL,15,Fcould only have done before her life
OL,16,Fbecame "unbearable" and before she was
OL,17,Fready to end her life.
OL,19,FThe Childline founder, who is
OL,20,Fterminally ill with cancer, first
OL,21,Frevealed in December 2023 that she had
OL,22,Fjoined the Dignitas clinic.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
