OL,3,GNEWSAEsther Rantzen says she is too
OL,4,Afragile to travel to Switzerland to end
OL,5,Alife
OL,6,
OL,7,FDame Esther used her statement on
OL,8,FThursday to reiterate a plea for MPs to
OL,9,Fvote in favour of legalising assisted
OL,10,Fdying in England and Wales when
OL,11,Fproposed legislation is revisited by
OL,12,FParliament on Friday.
